# profile: openrouter
# @tier: 1
# @summary: OpenRouter (one key, many models) over Chat Completions; embeddings through the same endpoint.
# @key: your OpenRouter key in OPENAI_API_KEY and in EMBEDDING_API_KEY (.env). Both are required: the chat key
#   is never sent to a separate embeddings host.
# @cost: pay per token at OpenRouter's prices; no OpenRouter prices ship, so cost is null unless you add them
# @dotnet: yes
# @verified: NOT VERIFIED. The wiring is the generic OpenAI-compatible path (stub-tested); OpenRouter itself has
#   never been called from this repo, and whether its embeddings endpoint serves the model below is unchecked.
#   OpenRouter may rename or drop cached-token fields, so cost can read high.
# @evals: live quality and safety suites through the eval CLI, capability check
# @judge: not the model under test. Suggestion only, not calibrated (D-7, M3).
# @judge-env: JUDGE_PROVIDER=openai JUDGE_MODEL=gpt-5.1
LLM_PROVIDER=openai
LLM_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
LLM_API=chat_completions
LLM_MODEL=openai/gpt-4.1
EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=openai_compatible
EMBEDDING_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
EMBEDDING_MODEL=openai/text-embedding-3-small
EMBEDDING_DIM=1536
